dden="true"></div><div class="index_prizeName__l799H" title="Trial fund">Trial fund</div><div class="index_imageGroup__JR08Z"><img alt loading="lazy" width="62" height="62" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="index_image__Q9g1w" style="color:transparent" src="https://d2tfhb4luz96yb.cloudfront.net/otc/images/banner/0d6fd8c4ec124c404c958285782e84d2093338b16f07a48b8b011ededb63ae05.webp"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="card_cardBetweenItemWrapper__2nW0v"><div class="card_cardBetween__y_L5N"><div class="card_pureDiv__ivyjW"><div class="card_cardBetweenHeader__MFEJr card_singleCardTaskHeader__TZ1F9"><div class="card_cardBetweenTitle__a3i5S">Net deposit</div><div class="card_holdDays__WR0aw" style="background:#EAC0031F"><span>Held for <span class="holdDaysProgress"><b>0</b>/3</span> days</span></div></div><div class="card_cardBetweenProgress__3DVTY"><span class="MuiLinearProgress-root MuiLinearProgress-colorPrimary MuiLinearProgress-determinate card_determinate__KqGlj css-7p5u54" role="progressbar" aria-valuenow="0" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100"><span class="MuiLinearProgress-bar MuiLinearProgress-barColorPrimary card_barColorPrimary__B2mLj MuiLinearProgress-bar1Determinate css-t752vm" style="transform:translateX(-100%)"></span></span></div><div class="card_singleCardProgressValue__QH98O"><span><span style="color: #ffeb52; font-size: 12px; margin: 0 2px;">0</span> / 500 USDT</span></div></div><div class="index_buttonWrapper___1DkO buttonWrapper index_showShort__i8V8H"><button type="button" name="promo_deposit_button" class="glass md-btn">Deposit</button></div></div><div class="card_cardTaskTypeWrapper__0_m2_"><div class="card_cardTaskTypeBox__gHOja _cardTaskTypeBox"><span class="card_cardTaskType__q9tfs">&amp;</span></div></div><div class="card_cardBetween__y_L5N"><div class="card_pureDiv__ivyjW"><div class="card_cardBetweenHeader__MFEJr card_singleCardTaskHeader__TZ1F9"><div class="card_cardBetweenTitle__a3i5S">Futures volume</div></div><div class="card_cardBetweenProgress__3DVTY"><span class="MuiLinearProgress-root MuiLinearProgress-colorPrimary MuiLinearProgress-determinate card_determinate__KqGlj css-7p5u54" role="progressbar" aria-valuenow="0" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100"><span class="MuiLinearProgress-bar MuiLinearProgress-barColorPrimary card_barColorPrimary__B2mLj MuiLinearProgress-bar1Determinate css-t752vm" style="transform:translateX(-100%)"></span></span></div><div class="card_singleCardProgressValue__QH98O"><span><span style="color: #ffeb52; font-size: 12px; margin: 0 2px;">0</span> / 30,000 USDT</span></div></div><div class="index_buttonWrapper___1DkO buttonWrapper index_showShort__i8V8H"><button type="button" name="promo-trade-button-10000001" class="glass md-btn">Trade now</button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="hiddenBottom"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class style="min-height:0px"></div><div id="eventRules" class="index_eventRules__P15qV index_promo__VgRLm"><div class="index_eventRulesContent__4_wUJ"><div class="index_title__y5mGv">Event rules</div><div class="index_contentPanel__1mCGg"><div style="max-height:88px" class="index_rules__c4P8p"><div class="ql-editor index_ruleItem__W_Pbw"><p>Eligibility &amp; participation</p><p>1. This event is exclusive to users who sign up via the designated referral link.</p><p>2. Use the "Register Now" button to join the event. Only deposits and trading volume after registration will count.</p><p><br></p><p>Event period &amp; tasks</p><p>1. After you register for the event, the system will start counting your trading volume.</p><p>2. Only trades from selected USDT-M pairs are eligible. Trading volume from Coin-M pairs, zero-fee trades, 0% maker fee trades, and stablecoin pairs such as USDCUSDT will not be counted.</p><p>3. Futures trading volume = open volume + close volume.</p><p>4. Net deposit = total deposits – total withdrawals.</p><p>5. Transactions made using coupons or trial funds are not valid for this event.</p><p>6. Trading volume generated via API is not eligible for this event and will be excluded from the final calculation.</p><p><br></p><p>Rewards &amp; distribution</p><p>1. Rewards will be distributed within seven working days after the event ends.</p><p>2. Rewards from similar events are not cumulative. If you participate in multiple events, only the highest reward will be granted.</p><p>3. Rewards will be issued to Vouchers and need to be claimed manually. Rewards have a claim period, and any reward not claimed after being issued will expire automatically.</p><p>4. The offset rate for this event's trial fund rewards is 50% and the validity period is seven days.</p><p><br></p><p>Legal provisions</p><p>1. In case of any abnormalities found during the review and distribution process, WEEX reserves the right to request users to complete verification to verify their reward eligibility.</p><p>2. In the event of bulk registrations, wash trading, cheating, or other violations, WEEX will disqualify the user and revoke any rewards.</p><p>3. WEEX reserves the right to modify or change the event terms at any time without prior notice, including but not limited to the cancellation, extension, termination, or suspension of this event.</p></div></div><div class="index_button__LjlEh"><img alt="expand" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/activity_static/static/images/newbieActivities/up.svg"></div></div></div></div></div></div></main><div id="global-footer"></div></div><footer id="initial-remote-layout-footer" class="initialRemoteLayoutFooter" dir="ltr" lang="en"><div class="initialRemoteLayoutFooterInner"><div class="initialRemoteLayoutFooterBrand"><img class="initialRemoteLayoutFooterLogo" src="/activity_static/static/images/initial-remote-layout/footer/weex-logo.svg" width="114" height="24" alt="WEEX"><div class="initialRemoteLayoutFooterSocials"><a class="initialRemoteLayoutFooterSocialLink" href="https://