 daily updates and monthly events. Get event times, reward details, and participation details instantly.","seo.description.leaderboard":"Check the WEEX futures trading leaderboard for daily, weekly, and monthly rankings. Track top crypto traders, futures trading volume, and latest leaderboard results.","seo.description.rewardhub":"Explore the WEEX Rewards Hub and complete tasks to win crypto rewards. View tasks, conditions, and rewards, all in one place.","seo.description.useragent":"Join the WEEX referral program and invite friends via your exclusive referral link to earn up to 40% lifetime commission, plus unlock referral rewards and leaderboard perks.","seo.title.calendar":"WEEX Event Calendar | Crypto Spot and Futures Trading Events","seo.title.leaderboard":"WEEX Leaderboard | Futures Trading Rankings and Top Traders","seo.title.rewardhub":"WEEX Rewards Hub | Complete Tasks to Unlock Crypto Rewards","seo.title.useragent":"WEEX Referral Program | Invite Friends and Earn Commission","sports.back":"Back","sports.futures.trading_volume":"Futures volume","sports.invite.requirement.net_deposit":"Net deposit","sports.spot.trading_volume":"Spot volume","team.confirm.create":"Confirm","team.searchInput":"Search","trade.competition.prizePool":"Prize pool","user_aside.help_center":"Help","user_aside.preference":"Preferences","user_setting.setting":"Settings","useragent.invite.code":"Referral code","verision.lower":"The current app version does not support this operation. Please update your app to the latest version.","voucher.center":"Vouchers","voucher.center.description":"Activate it in Vouchers","voucher.daily_income":"Fixed boost","voucher.daily_income_desc":"Fixed boosts let you earn a fixed extra reward each day on top of your base returns. Applicable to Auto Earn and staking.","voucher.financial_plus":"APR boost","voucher.financial_plus_desc":"APR boosts give you extra yield on top of your base APR. Applicable to Auto Earn and staking.","voucher.my_vouchers":"Vouchers","voucher.reward_issued_to":"Check {{text}} for details","voucher.vip_days":"{{num}} days","welcome.additional_kyc_terms":"Note: Identity verification may be required to claim your reward.","welcome.bind_base_info.app_reset_security_option":"Go to the WEEX app and tap on the 9-dot menu to go to \"Security\" and reset your phone number or email.","welcome.bind_base_info.bind_email":"Link email","welcome.bind_base_info.bind_mobile":"Link phone number","welcome.bind_base_info.commit":"Submit","welcome.bind_base_info.confirm":"Confirm","welcome.bind_base_info.email":"Email","welcome.bind_base_info.email_code":"Email verification code","welcome.bind_base_info.forget_security_option":"Forgot security option?","welcome.bind_base_info.google_code":"Google Authenticator","welcome.bind_base_info.input_correct_email":"Please enter a valid email address","welcome.bind_base_info.input_correct_mobile":"Please enter a valid phone number","welcome.bind_base_info.input_email":"Enter your email address","welcome.bind_base_info.input_email_code":"Please enter the email verification code","welcome.bind_base_info.input_google_code":"Enter the Google Authenticator code","welcome.bind_base_info.input_mobile":"Enter your phone number","welcome.bind_base_info.input_search_key":"Please enter a keyword to search","welcome.bind_base_info.input_sms_code":"Please enter the SMS verification code","welcome.bind_base_info.security_tooltip":"If you can't find the email containing the verification code from WEEX in your inbox, please check the spam folder and move the email to the inbox.","welcome.bind_base_info.security_validation":"Security verification","welcome.bind_base_info.send_again":"Resend","welcome.bind_base_info.send_right":"Send","welcome.bind_base_info.sms_code":"SMS verification code","welcome.bind_base_info.wait_one_minute":"Please wait","welcome.bind_success.email_message":"Your email has been linked.","welcome.bind_success.email_title":"Email linked","welcome.bind_success.mobile_message":"Your phone number has been linked.","welcome.bind_success.mobile_title":"Phone linked","welcome.compensation.description":"Make a net deposit of ≥ {{rechargeValue}} USDT and get rewarded if you incur a loss on your first futures trade.","welcome.compensation.description_2":"Make a net deposit of ≥ {{rechargeValue}} USDT and get rewarded if you incur a loss on your first futures trade of ≥ {{tradingVolume}} USDT.","welcome.compensation.title":"First futures trade protection","welcome.compensation.tooltips":"1) Deposit the required amount of USDT and maintain your net deposit.\u003cbr/\u003e2) Complete your first futures trade with any token. If you incur a loss, you will get compensation.\u003cbr/\u003eNote: Do not withdraw your USDT until you've received the task rewards, as this may prevent the task from being completed.","welcome.compensation.tooltips_2":"1) Meet the net deposit requirement.\u003cbr/\u003e2) Complete your first futures trade and meet the required volume.\u003cbr/\u003e3) Losses from your first futures trade will be covered.\u003cbr/\u003eNote: Do not withdraw before receiving rewards to avoid disqualification.","welcome.dialog.Tip":"Thank you for participating and completing verification. Following a security review, your account was found to be ineligible for rewards at this time. We appreciate your interest and hope to see you in future events.","welcome.event_end_title":"Event has ended","welcome.extra_reward":"Extra reward","welcome.financial.description":"Enable Auto Earn and keep it active for {{days}} days.","welcome.financial.title":"Auto Earn for beginners","welcome.financial.tooltips":"1) Keep Auto Earn enabled for at least {{days}} days.\u003cbr /\u003e2) Maintain an account balance of ≥ {{amount}} USDT.","welcome.first_feature_trading_msg":"Make your first futures trade of ≥ {{num1}} USDT.","welcome.first_feature_trading_title":"First futures trade","welcome.first_feature_trading_tooltip_new":"1) Complete your first futures trade and meet the required volume.\u003cbr /\u003e2) Claim the reward after completing all task requirements.\u003cbr /\u003eNote: Trades made with platform-issued rewards (such as trial funds, coupons, position airdrops) or through API trading will not be counted.","welcome.first_recharge_msg":"Make your first deposit of ≥ {{num1}} USDT and hold for {{days}} days.","welcome.first_recharge_msg_2":"Make your first deposit of ≥ {{num1}} USDT.","welcome.first_recharge_title":"First deposit task","welcome.first_recharge_tooltip":"1) Make your first deposit and meet the requirement.\u003cbr/\u003e2) Deposited funds must be held for {{days}} days. Any withdrawal during this period will disqualify rewards.\u003cbr/\u003e 3) On-chain deposits, P2P, and Quick Buy purchases are all eligible.\u003cbr/\u003eNote: Only your first deposit counts.","welcome.first_recharge_tooltip_2":"1) Make your first deposit and meet the requirement.\u003cbr/\u003e2) On-chain deposits, P2P, and Quick Buy purchases are all eligible.\u003cbr/\u003eNote: Only your first deposit counts.","welcome.first_trading_btn":"Trade","welcome.first_trading_msg":"Make your first spot trade of ≥ {{num1}} USDT.","welcome.first_trading_title":"First spot trade","welcome.first_trading_tooltip":"1) Reach the required volume for your first spot trade.\u003cbr/\u003e2) Claim your reward once task requirements are met.\u003cbr/\u003eNote: Only your first spot trade counts.","welcome.flip.description":"Join Poker Party and trade ≥ {{volume}} USDT in futures.","welcome.flip.description.zero_volume":"Join Poker Party and trade any futures.","welcome.flip.title":"Join the Poker Party and get daily rewards","welcome.flip.tooltip":"Select \"Join Now\" to enter Poker Party and complete tasks for rewards.","welcome.friendly_reminder":"Friendly reminder","welcome.go_draw":"Spin Now","welcome.go_draw_error":"There is no event running right now. Please stay tuned!","welcome.important_notice":"Important notice","welcome.invite_msg_new":"Invite {{count}} friends to make a net deposit of ≥ {{deposit}} USDT and trade ≥ {{volume}} USDT in futures.","welcome.invite_msg_new_total":"Invite {{count}} friends to make a net deposit of ≥ {{deposit}} USDT and trade ≥ {{volume}} USDT in spot or futures.","welcome.invite_msg_zero_both":"Invite {{count}} friends to make a deposit and trade futures.","welcome.invite_msg_zero_deposit":"Invite {{count}} friends to make a deposit and trade ≥ {{volume}} USDT in futures.","welcome.invite_msg_zero_deposit_total":"Invite {{count}} friends to make a deposit and trade ≥ {{volume}} USDT in spot or futures.","welcome.invite_msg_zero_volume":"Invite {{count}} friends to make a net deposit of ≥ {{deposit}} USDT and trade any futures.","welcome.invite_title":"Invite friends and earn together!","welcome.invite_tooltip":"1) Invite friends to sign up using your exclusive referral link or code, and have them complete the required tasks.\u003cbr /\u003e2) Your invitees must meet the requirements for both of you to receive rewards.","welcome.kol_alert":"Enter your invitation code to claim your reward","welcome.kol_btn":"Enter code","welcome.kol_msg":"Use the special invitation code to claim a \u003ci\u003e{{num1}} {{code}}\u003c/i\u003e reward.","welcome.kol_sucess":"Linked!","welcome.kol_title":"Win with your invitation code","welcome.kol_tooltip":"1) The invitation code must be obtained from official or specialized channels, KOLs, influencers, or community leaders.\u003cbr /\u003e2) The invitation code is only valid for new users.\u003cbr /\u003e3) The invitation code can only be used once.\u003cbr /\u003e4) The invitation code entered after registration cannot be changed.\u003cbr /\u003e5) No changes can be made to the entered code.\u003cbr /\u003e6) The reward will be credited to your account after the invitation code is entered.","welcome.kor_kol_bin_msg":"Verify your identity in an eligible region and use referral code \"rxxk\" to unlock an 80% fee rebate.","welcome.kor_kol_bin_tips":"Eligibility is based on your verified region and linked referral code. If either does not meet the event requirements, you will not receive the fee rebate or task rewards. Contact customer support if you have questions about eligibility.","welcome.kor_kol_bin_title":"Link the exclusive referral code","welcome.kyc_alert":"You're just one step away from claiming your reward! Please go to the app and complete identity verification immediately.","welcome.kyc_btn":"Verify","welcome.kyc_failed_notice_message_1":"Your IP address doesn't match your verified country. Contact customer support to claim rewards for your verified region.","welcome.kyc_failed_notice_message_2":"If you currently reside in your IP address country, you can submit valid proof of residence to our customer service for verification. Upon approval, you will receive the reward amount displayed on this page.","welcome.kyc_msg":"Complete identity verification.","welcome.kyc_required":"ID verification required","welcome.kyc_title":"Identity verification","welcome.kyc_tooltip":"1）Use the \"Verify\" button and go to the WEEX app to verify your identity.\u003cbr /\u003e2）Complete identity verification to get your reward.","welcome.limited_offer":"Limited offer","welcome.limited_reward":"Reward {{code}} {{num}}","welcome.maintain.one.day":"Held for {{num}} day","welcome.maintain.several.days":"Held for {{num}} days","welcome.maintained":"Held for {{num1}} days","welcome.register_btn_bind_email":"Link email","welcome.register_btn_bind_mobile":"Link phone no.","welcome.register_mobile_msg":"Link your email address.","welcome.register_msg":"Link your phone number and email.","welcome.register_phone_msg":"Link your phone number.","welcome.register_title":"Secure your account","welcome.register_tooltip_1":"1. Use the \"Sign Up\" button.\u003cbr /\u003e2. Link your phone number and email after you sign up. Your reward will be credited to your account within 48 hours after approval.","welcome.register_tooltip_2":"1. Use the \"Sign Up\" button.\u003cbr /\u003e2. Link your phone number after you sign up. Your reward will be credited to your account within 48 hours after approval.","welcome.register_tooltip_3":"1. Use the \"Sign Up\" button.\u003cbr /\u003e2. Link your email after you sign up. Your reward will be credited to your account within 48 hours after approval.","welcome.spot_trading_title":"Spot trading","welcome.status_btn_claimed":"Claimed","welcome.task.any_feature_trading.msg":"Complete any futures trade.","welcome.task.any_feature_trading.tips.new":"Complete a futures trade on any pair to claim the reward.\u003cbr /\u003eNote: Trades made with platform-issued rewards (such as trial funds, coupons, position airdrops), or made via API, will not be counted.","welcome.task.any_feature_trading.title":"Make a Futures Trade","welcome.task.any_spot_trading.msg":"Complete any spot trade.","welcome.task.any_spot_trading.tips":"1) Execute a spot trade with any cryptocurrency.\u003cbr /\u003e2) Complete any spot trade to claim the task reward.","welcome.task.any_spot_trading.title":"Make a Spot Trade","welcome.token2049.description":"Join the TOKEN2049 event, deposit {{amount}} USDT, and hold for {{days}} days to get an event pack.","welcome.token2049.modal.description":"Scan the email QR code to enter the AI Trading Competition. See the email for rewards, schedule, and offline event invites.","welcome.token2049.modal.tip":"AI Trading event slots are fully claimed due to high demand. Thanks for participating!","welcome.token2049.modal.title":"Check your email for the TOKEN2049 event pack","welcome.token2049.success":"Prize sent to your email. Contact customer support if you have any questions.","welcome.token2049.tip":"1) Two competition sessions are held daily, with a maximum of 100 participants per lobby. Entry closes once the lobby is full. \u003cbr /\u003e 2) The competition schedule, start times, and other event details are subject to the official email notification. Check your registered email for details. \u003cbr /\u003e 3) Trades can only be placed using AI chat commands. Eligible trading assets are ADA, SOL, LTC, DOGE, BTC, ETH, XRP, and BNB. Other assets and trading methods are not eligible.","welcome.token2049.title":"TOKEN2049 AI Trading Competition","welcome.trade_tooltip_new":"1) Trade any futures pair.\u003cbr /\u003e2) Reach the required futures volume to claim the reward.\u003cbr /\u003eNote: Trades made with platform-issued rewards (such as trial funds, coupons, position airdrops) or through API trading will not be counted.","welcome.trade_trading_count_tooltip_new":"1) Trade any futures pair.\u003cbr /\u003e2) Reach the required futures volume and number of trades to claim the reward.\u003cbr /\u003eNote: Trades made with platform-issued rewards (such as trial funds, coupons, position airdrops) or through API trading will not be counted.","welcome.trading_and_trading_count_msg":"Trade ≥ {{num1}} USDT in futures and make ≥ {{tradingCount}} trades.","welcome.trading_count_requirement":"Trades: {{current}}\u003cspan class='total'\u003e/{{total}}\u003c/span\u003e","welcome.trading_msg":"Trade ≥ {{num1}} USDT in futures.","welcome.trading_title":"Trade futures","welcome.transfer_msg1":"Transfer ≥ {{num}} USDT to your futures account and keep a net balance of ≥ {{num1}} USDT for {{num2}} days.","welcome.transfer_msg2":"Trade ≥ {{num}} USDT in futures.","welcome.transfer_title":"Futures transfer","welcome.transfer_tooltip":"1) Transfer the required USDT amount and hold it in your account.\u003cbr /\u003e2) You will not be able to complete the task if you make any withdrawals or transfers that result in failure to meet the required transfer amount.","welcome.zero_fee.description":"Join the 0% fee event and trade ≥ {{volume}} USDT in futures.","welcome.zero_fee.description.zero_volume":"Join the 0% fee event and trade any futures.","welcome.zero_fee.title":"Trade gold, stocks, and crude oil with 0% fees","welcome.ze