askType":"RECHARGE","updateTime":1793608261000,"version":1}],"taskTypeList":[],"title":"","titleI18":[{"lang":"en_US","name":"20% deposit cashback"},{"lang":"es_ES","name":"20% de cashback por depósito"}],"virtualRankingParams":[],"webUrl":"","webUrlI18":[]}],"miningList":[],"monopolyList":[],"multiLanguageTemplateId":115,"newUser":false,"newUserDynamicBonusSharingParams":[],"newUserFixedBonusSharingParams":[],"ogImageUrl":"","onlineScope":2,"operationTeamList":[],"operator":"JulieMu","periods":0,"portalInfo":[],"prize":[],"prizeColorTagWeightConfig":[],"prizeLimited":[],"prizePool":[],"prizePoolIds":[],"prizePoolIntroI18":[],"prizeWeight":[],"prizeWeightConfig":[],"projectName":"","projectRule":"","questions":[],"questionsI18n":[],"raceFixBonusPoolParams":[],"removeFlag":true,"requirements":[],"resourceConfig":[],"routineSubTitleI18n":[],"routineTaskConfig":[],"routineTitleI18n":[],"rules":[{"lang":"en_US","list":[{"content":"\u003cp\u003eEligibility \u0026amp; participation\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e1. This event is exclusive to users who sign up via the designated referral link.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e2. Use the \"Register Now\" button to join the event. Only deposits and trading volume after registration will count.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEvent period \u0026amp; tasks\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e1. After you register for the event, the system will start counting your trading volume.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e2. Only trades from selected USDT-M pairs are eligible. Trading volume from Coin-M pairs, zero-fee trades, 0% maker fee trades, and stablecoin pairs such as USDCUSDT will not be counted.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e3. Futures trading volume = open volume + close volume.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e4. Net deposit = total deposits – total withdrawals.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e5. Transactions made using coupons or trial funds are not valid for this event.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e6. Trading volume generated via API is not eligible for this event and will be excluded from the final calculation.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRewards \u0026amp; distribution\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e1. Rewards will be distributed within seven working days after the event ends.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e2. Rewards from similar events are not cumulative. If you participate in multiple events, only the highest reward will be granted.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e3. Rewards will be issued to Vouchers and need to be claimed manually. Rewards have a claim period, and any reward not claimed after being issued will expire automatically.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e4. The offset rate for this event's trial fund rewards is 50% and the validity period is seven days.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLegal provisions\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e1. In case of any abnormalities found during the review and distribution process, WEEX reserves the right to request users to complete verification to verify their reward eligibility.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e2. In the event of bulk registrations, wash trading, cheating, or other violations, WEEX will disqualify the user and revoke any rewards.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e3. WEEX reserves the right to modify or change the event terms at any time without prior notice, including but not limited to the cancellation, extension, termination, or suspension of this event.\u003c/p\u003e","title":"Event rules"}]},{"lang":"es_ES","list":[{"content":"\u003cp\u003eElegibilidad y participación\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e1. Este evento es exclusivo para los usuarios que se registren a través del enlace de referidos designado.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e2. Utiliza el botón “Registrarme ahora” para unirte al evento. Los depósitos y el volumen de trading solo se contarán después del registro.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePeriodo del evento y tareas\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e1. El sistema comenzará a contabilizar tu volumen de trading luego de que te registres en el evento.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e2. Solo son elegibles las operaciones de los pares USDT-M seleccionados. No se incluirán los volúmenes de trading de los pares Coin-M, las operaciones sin comisiones, las operaciones sin comisiones de maker y los pares de stablecoins, como USDCUSDT.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e3. Volumen de trading de futuros = volumen de apertura + volumen de cierre.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e4. Depósito neto = depósitos totales - retiros totales.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e5. Las transacciones realizadas con cupones o fondos de prueba no son válidas para este evento.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e6. El volumen de trading generado a través de la API no es elegible para este evento y se excluirá del cálculo final.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRecompensas y distribución\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e1. Las recompensas se distribuirán en un plazo de siete días laborables después de que finalice el evento.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e2. Las recompensas de eventos similares no son acumulables. Si participas en varios eventos, solo se te concederá la recompensa más alta.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e3. Se emitirán recompensas a los cupones y deberán reclamarse manualmente. Las recompensas tienen un período de reclamación, y cualquier recompensa no reclamada después de ser emitida caducará automáticamente.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e4. La tasa de compensación para las recompensas del fondo de prueba de este evento es del 50% y el periodo de validez es de siete días.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDisposiciones legales\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e1. En caso de que se encuentren irregularidades durante el proceso de revisión y distribución, WEEX se reserva el derecho de solicitar a los usuarios que completen una verificación para comprobar si cumplen los requisitos para recibir la recompensa.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e2. En el caso de que se produzcan registros masivos, operaciones ficticias, trampas u otras infracciones, WEEX descalificará al usuario y revocará las recompensas.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e3. WEEX se reserva el derecho de modificar o cambiar los términos del evento en cualquier momento sin previo aviso, incluyendo, pero no limitado a, la cancelación, extensión, terminación o suspensión de este evento.\u003c/p\u003e","title":"Reglas del evento"}]}],"shareContent":"Get 20% deposit cashback","showActivityCalendar":0,"showActivityRewards":false,"showBeginCountdown":false,"showBeginnerTaskConfig":[],"showCountdown":true,"showEndCountdown":false,"showIntroFlag":0,"showMerryRound":0,"showPublic":false,"showRegion":[],"showResource":0,"showResourceModel":0,"showSchedule":"NO","showUrl":"eze-exclusive","stage":"FINISHED","startTime":1794466800000,"status":"OFFLINE","subActivityList":[],"subActivityType":0,"subTeamActivityList":[],"subTitle":"\u003cp\u003eSign up to get VIP 2 perks and $300 in trial funds!\u003c/p\u003e","taskConfig":[],"taskConfigIds":[],"taskRequirement":[],"teamBonusSharingParams":[],"teamStatsParams":[],"title":"\u003cp\u003eGet 20% deposit cashback\u003c/p\u003e","tradeSpotInfo":[],"tradeSymbolInfo":[],"tradfiPredictions":[],"type":"TRACE_PRO","updateTime":1794495140000,"userData":[],"virtualRankingParams":[],"visible":0,"webAnimationFlag":0,"webBannerUrl":"https://d2tfhb4luz96yb.cloudfront.net/otc/images/banner/c5e26d4076dce77b3b2d8a0144df5a06f311abcc03dd3c3c5912313bbda53221.webp","webScoreUrl":"","webShareUrl":"https://d2tfhb4luz96yb.cloudfront.net/otc/images/banner/f108fb5ce2444043bb46862b7bc833df4581ed5c55570c061dc6b5e34826e90a.webp","webThumbnailUrl":""},"defaultLangAndQuestion":{"activityId":12930,"agentShareContent":"Get 20% deposit cashback","appBannerUrl":"","appScoreUrl":"","appShareUrl":"","expanded":1,"intro":"","questions":[],"shareContent":"Get 20% deposit cashback","subTitle":"\u003cp\u003eSign up to get VIP 2 perks and $300 in trial funds!\u003c/p